        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9fb6b0ef951fbb1ca7eec7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场比赛的最后直线很长，\n有时候尾段加速会成为决胜关键。\n就脚质来看对她很不利……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8d69b21d44d492aa524196c5336d1d0ab436e1dd8a5d569da4c24c7d689094",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
