      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再来，就是她能不能在比赛中学到什么了。\n没错──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d45e5493504c0f2312ec1cca1d42dd792d6a79d2346c322ddc66b67bcec7530",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d0dd0caee6c710e6b170b50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在有急弯，且没有坡道的赛道举办的重赏比赛。\n场地条件如此特殊，她能顺利地跑完吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6ba27926ea6e7c5ddabc084cecd8e36a0fdb58fa7004f1aaa2bb2cf3ab112b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78fef99279b540ba3be713aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前几天，\n双涡轮尽情地四处逛着观光景点，而且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8addf1bf87636264563076b2fa9361757c3f204f583807d82cfc7139469423cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
