    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61b405941bc96ac4fcf980c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n涡轮今天感觉引擎充满能量喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a065515d664499a51e2e3aacae5905495b2bfa8acd56a4a6c81998458f30e6f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dafeb9ced033ab9c966233fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮身材娇小，并且在奔跑时\n总是燃烧身心到极限，导致她的体重略为减轻。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0969314c68670cc4f03dda218b540f2d0beee135a9565248b9d87e27ea404983",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139f5b80d053654aa82ed93a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到福岛后，她的身体看起来大幅地恢复了。\n看来不只是赛道，\n似乎连当地风土民情都很适合她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee163cec35a06bd9cb4e4138b75acea8b3f52c08a13ee82b5b65b9e4563eeeab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066203.json",
      "json_path": [
