      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f587bc8b63b9c0760234cd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，这场比赛中，\n也有许多实力坚强的赛马娘出赛，不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e51998f5fc9b5b12dcc690cccf0783db424de627c55d754ab81d8f45c5b53f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab52b48522ea0953486224a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位赛马娘是丸善斯基。\n是个言行带着泡沫时期的调调，\n并轻松驾驭超跑的酷炫赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a73a89d6e2772522cd828d75adb19fa30cf74907a7ec311e2f9fa1caa6ff99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9bc84cabbb91ff5099a98f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来，她是来声援中意的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38156d3fe27c76224399f81d877eaa4a1d0aa64795bcb472030960b75a92ca1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
